1
00:00:00,510 --> 00:00:02,750
(Leonard:)Okay.

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:05,150
(Sheldon:)Excuse me?

3
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:07,820
(Sheldon:)Isn't this the point
where the world-weary barkeep

4
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:09,920
(Sheldon:)absentmindedly
wipes down the bar

5
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,660
(Sheldon:)and coaxes the woes
out of the troubled patron?

6
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:16,340
(Penny:)Well, I was getting your
stupid umbrella, but all right.

7
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:19,200
(clears throat)

8
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,460
(Penny:)What's troubling you, buddy?

9
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,740
(Sheldon:)I don't think your heart's
in it, but since you asked...

10
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:30,040
(Sheldon:)Apparently, because
Leonard is dating Raj's sister,

11
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:32,360
(Sheldon:)we're all forced
to hang out at his apartment.

12
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:34,950
(Penny:)Oh, the horror.

13
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:36,200
(Sheldon:)Indeed.

14
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:38,550
(Sheldon:)Yeah, at one point,
Raj put on reggae music,

15
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:40,580
(Sheldon:)and his sister
took off her shoes.

16
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:43,220
(Sheldon:)It was like the last days
of Caligula.

17
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,760
(cell phone chiming)

18
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:49,960
(Sheldon:)Oh, I have to get this.

19
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,760
(Sheldon:)Umbrella?

20
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,300
(Leonard:)Ugh!

21
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:57,170
(Sheldon:)Wonder
what she's exasperated about.

